      "The tightening program must come from get-program for variant F30",
      "The tightening must be evaluated and recorded for traceability"
    ],
    "preference": "",
    "priority": "normal",
    "horizon": "Once, before the next use of NR7 on line 2",
    "requested_capabilities": ["calibrate-tool"],
    "omit_services": []
  },
